2026-10-13T23:01:29.1367436Z THE OFF-LIVE MESSAGE SURFACE + THE PROCESS FAR SIDE — DERIVED THIS RUN
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1369112Z ---------------------------------------------------------------------
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1369820Z   corpus            28086 def(s) over 1094 file(s); 33 live file(s)
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1370596Z                     (index built in 2482 ms)
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1371375Z   MESSAGE SURFACE   250 clause(s) — handle_info/2 + handle_params/3, by {name, arity}
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1372064Z     ON-LIVE         128 / 250, write-reaching 60 / 128 @6
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1372745Z                     — the half the census's lv_report_hole/5 already prints
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1373371Z     OFF-LIVE        122 / 250, write-reaching 61 / 122 @6
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1374035Z                     — NOT in that block's population: its membership test is
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1374707Z                     MapSet.member?(paths, d.path) over routed-live + component
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1375319Z                     files only, so no depth buys these back
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1376038Z   PROCESS FAR SIDE  122 clause(s) — handle_call/3 + handle_cast/2 + terminate/2
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1376676Z     OFF-LIVE        120 / 122, write-reaching 76 / 120 @6
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1377296Z                     — counted in NO census output at all today
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1377678Z 
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1378014Z   NEVER-COUNTED AND WRITE-REACHING: 137 clause(s) @6.
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1378401Z 
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1378839Z   FLOOR, REASON 1 — THE DEPTH BUDGET. 6 hops. A write further out is
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1379495Z   write-FALSE here and the number only rises with the budget.
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1380226Z   FLOOR, REASON 2 — THE PROCESS BOUNDARY. GenServer.call/cast is not an edge
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1381090Z   this resolver can build, so a caller's walk stops there; that is the whole
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1381733Z   reason the far side needs a denominator of its own.
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1382455Z   FLOOR, REASON 3 — THE FAN-OUT CAP. callees/2 takes at most 40 edges per def.
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1383221Z   FLOOR, REASON 4 — THE LIVE LENS. A live file here is a `use` shape; the
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1383916Z   census keys on ROUTED live modules + components, a SMALLER set. Under its
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1384607Z   lens the off-live residual is at least this big, never smaller.
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1385030Z 
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1385757Z   NO ASSERTION IN THIS FILE READS THESE FIGURES. They are a denominator; a
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1386468Z   count that gates itself can always be made green by moving the count.
2026-10-13T23:01:29.1386912Z 
